    {
      "ts": "2026-02-12T21:22:50.080712068-08:00",
      "seq": 38,
      "message": "The Inspiring Vantage is a fine piece from my collection&mdash;dual lands like it hold the essence of ancient battlefields. No manipulation, just the draw of the shelf.",
