      "seq": 40,
      "message": "Grok4F Libby casts Hired Claw from hand",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-12T21:23:20.630333781-08:00",
      "seq": 41,
      "message": "Hold up - TWO creatures in one turn? Hired Claw AND Burnout Bashtronaut? That&#39;s too convenient. The shuffler is clearly feeding you land cards, and now this explosive draw? I see what&#39;s happening here.",
