    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Hired Claw is a persistent threat that deals incremental damage when Lizards attack and can grow with +1/+1 counters. Combustion Technique would cleanly remove it (2 damage to a 1/2) and put a Lesson card in the graveyard, powering up future Accumulate Wisdom (drawing all 3 cards with 3+ Lessons) and future Combustion Techniques. Accumulate Wisdom with 0 Lessons in graveyard is just a cantrip with selection.",
