    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Chose Accumulate Wisdom over Firebending Lesson from the Accumulate Wisdom resolution. The player already has card advantage tools (Three Steps Ahead) and needs removal against the aggressive board (Hired Claw + Burnout Bashtronaut). Firebending Lesson would provide additional removal and, once cast, would go to the graveyard as a Lesson card, powering up both future Combustion Techniques and future Accumulate Wisdoms.",
